# Tools to build the minimal OpenCV (core, imgproc, photo) from the opencv-python-headless source
# release in packaging/requirements-macos.txt, for the macOS Universal edition. numpy comes from the
# edition's own lock (the same version the app ships). Never bundled into the app.
#   uv pip compile packaging/requirements-opencv-build.in --python-version 3.13 --universal \
#     --generate-hashes --no-header -o packaging/requirements-opencv-build.txt
